        "name": "get_agent_result",
        "description": "Get a subagent's final reply as answer, status and exit state. Captured replies up to 65,536 UTF-16 code units are retained in memory and returned in bounded pages. Start without answerOffset; if answer.nextOffset is non-null, pass it as answerOffset until nextOffset is null. Concatenate page text in order before closing the child. sourceTruncated:true means the capture itself exceeded its limit: ask the worker to save its full deliverable in a project file and read it. Prefer answer; output is empty when a captured reply is present, otherwise it is a raw terminal tail.",
